# Project standards (must follow)

## Framework + routing

- Use **Next.js 14+ App Router** conventions (route handlers in `app/api/**/route.ts`, server components by default, client components only when needed).
- Prefer server actions / route handlers over legacy patterns; do not introduce Pages Router (`pages/`).

## TypeScript

- Use **TypeScript** in **strict mode**.
- Keep types narrow and explicit; avoid `any` (use `unknown` + refinement when necessary).

## Styling

- Use **Tailwind CSS only**.
- **No inline styles** (`style={{ ... }}`) and no ad-hoc CSS files unless the project already uses them in the exact area you’re modifying.

## Components

- Use **functional components only** (no class components).
- Keep components small and composable; extract reusable UI into shared components following existing patterns.

## Structure

- **Follow the existing file/folder structure** in this repo.
- Before adding new directories, check for an established location/pattern for similar code and match it.

